      "with": ["ingredient/salt", "ingredient/sunflower-oil"],
      "text": "Dry the {scallop:plural} very well on paper and {salt} them. Heat the {sunflower-oil} in a heavy pan until it just begins to smoke. Set the {scallop:plural} in, flat side down and well apart, and do not touch them until a deep brown crust has formed.",
